Our records show that the following invoices on your account are overdue. This may be an oversight, if you have already paid please ignore this reminder.

{invoices}
Total overdue: {currency} {amount}

Please arrange payment at your earliest convenience.

Kind regards,
{company}'),(2,'en_GB.utf8','Second reminder: overdue account','Dear {name},

We wrote to you recently about overdue invoices on your account and have not yet received payment. The following invoices remain unpaid.

{invoices}
Total overdue: {currency} {amount}

Please pay immediately or contact us to discuss.

Kind regards,
{company}'),(3,'en_GB.utf8','FINAL NOTICE: overdue account','Dear {name},

Despite our earlier reminders the following invoices remain unpaid.

{invoices}
Total overdue: {currency} {amount}

Unless payment is received within 7 days your account will be put on stop, no further orders will be supplied and late payment interest and fees will be charged.

Kind regards,
{company}');

